## What the licence above does and does not cover

The MIT grant above applies to this repository's own work: the engine, the
tooling, and the art pipeline — every sprite, tile, sky and effect in this
project is drawn from code that lives here, and there is not one image asset
in the repository.

It does not, and cannot, grant anything in respect of One Piece. One Piece is
created by Eiichiro Oda and is © Eiichiro Oda / Shueisha / Toei Animation.
This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project with no affiliation with,
sponsorship by, or endorsement from any of them. Character names appear here
as homage; the drawings are this project's own and are not traced, copied or
transcribed from the manga, the anime, or any other game.

Reuse the code. The names are not ours to license.
